
0 [ 1 2 3 ] [ + ] each 6 == check
0 5 [ 1 + ] times 5 == check
3 [ 0 > ] [ 1 - ] while 0 == check

\ Nested iteration preserves the surrounding accumulator.
0 2 [ 2 [ 1 + ] times ] times 4 == check

\ A body that binds captures gets a fresh scope for every iteration.
1 3 [ | current | $current 1 + ] times 4 == check

\ A capture-free body may still read a capture from its caller.
'add-captured [ | increment | 0 3 [ $increment + ] times ] def
2 add-captured 6 == check
